abstract: >-
  Article-specific reproducibility package for the BigLoI PLOS ONE manuscript
  (PONE-D-26-13579R2), including submission files, figures, derived data,
  veterinary-exclusion audit artifacts, statements, and minimal reproduction scripts.
  Corrected closed cohort: 161,830 pharmaceutical contracts (2020-2025).
